// ----
low.func.def target<x86.avx512_features.core> abi(object_function) abi_layout({signature = (vector<16xbf16>, vector<16xbf16>) -> (vector<8xf32>)}) @bf16_dot2_negative_zero_256(%lhs: reg<x86.ymm>, %rhs: reg<x86.ymm>) -> (reg<x86.ymm>) asm {
  %9 = mov.imm32 -2147483648
  %cn0_scalar = vmovd.xmm.gpr32 %9
  %cn0 = vbroadcastss.ymm %cn0_scalar
  %12 = copy %cn0 : reg<x86.ymm> -> reg<x86.ymm>
  %dot = avx512_bf16.vdpbf16ps.ymm %12, %lhs, %rhs
